    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is no luck here, only your perception can save you. Turn on the flashlight and get ready for the ultimate challenge.</h2>With a difficulty where you must prepare yourself because every success feels deserved and every mistake is a lesson. Are you ready to face the darkness and what lies hidden in it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997670/extras/36e9fcd536ff2f8e4effa5995a3c4a20.poster.avif?t=1719501111\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997670/extras/36e9fcd536ff2f8e4effa5995a3c4a20.webm?t=1719501111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997670/extras/36e9fcd536ff2f8e4effa5995a3c4a20.mp4?t=1719501111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2>In Infinite Innocence, you will face a challenge that tests your perception. This is no ordinary game of anomalies, it is a test of cunning and determination. It is very easy to see anomalies with lighting, but what if we give it a little more difficulty and tension? There is no room for chance, each anomaly must be precisely identified and exterminated. The game offers increasing difficulty that will challenge even the most experienced players. Get ready to immerse yourself in an experience where light is your only guide and darkness, your greatest enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997670/extras/9bd20034bcd2bd04b8f204f40c73c292.poster.avif?t=1719501111\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997670/extras/9bd20034bcd2bd04b8f204f40c73c292.webm?t=1719501111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997670/extras/9bd20034bcd2bd04b8f204f40c73c292.mp4?t=1719501111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play and Features</h2>Memorize, find, assign and exterminate. Every mistake is paid dearly and every success brings you closer to the glory of being a true exterminator.<br><br>Will you be able to remember everything until the end?",
